WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.458 --> 00:00:02.916
You’re seriously
posting from campus?

00:00:02.916 --> 00:00:03.708
I'm not worried.

00:00:03.708 --> 00:00:05.708
It’s like you want
to get shut down.

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:08.416
[phones chiming]

00:00:08.416 --> 00:00:09.500
Hey, Bayview.

00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:13.875
School is back in session.
And you know what that means:

00:00:14.541 --> 00:00:15.666
So am I.

00:00:16.458 --> 00:00:17.208
This week,

00:00:17.208 --> 00:00:20.541
I'll be taking down four of
Bayview’s biggest offenders.

00:00:21.416 --> 00:00:22.791
Let's just say,

00:00:22.791 --> 00:00:24.541
I've got enough
dirt to bury them.

00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:29.958
Your obsession with other
people's lives is pathetic.

00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:32.083
Nobody at the school would
get called out for anything

00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:33.416
if it weren't for me.

00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:34.125
[cough]

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:34.625
Simon?

00:00:34.625 --> 00:00:35.833
[cough]

00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:36.416
[bang]

00:00:36.916 --> 00:00:37.791
Jesus, he's allergic.

00:00:37.791 --> 00:00:38.750
I don’t think he's breathing.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:39.625
You want to help?

00:00:43.291 --> 00:00:45.583
Detective Wheeler
has a couple questions.

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:46.583
Wasn't it an accident?

00:00:49.083 --> 00:00:50.375
They think
one of us did it.

00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:52.333
Without Simon, you
get to be valedictorian.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:54.208
You're accusing me now?

00:00:54.666 --> 00:00:55.583
I know them.

00:00:55.583 --> 00:00:56.416
I don’t know you.

00:01:00.291 --> 00:01:01.416
We need to work together now.

00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:03.250
And why should we trust you?

00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:07.750
So you guys have no secrets?

00:01:09.541 --> 00:01:11.291
I've got too much on the line.

00:01:12.375 --> 00:01:13.208
Tell them the truth.

00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:14.750
It's not gonna
change anything.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:16.750
Everybody here hated him.

00:01:21.125 --> 00:01:23.083
But who also hated us?

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:36.041
What is a secret worth
literally killing for?

00:01:36.041 --> 00:01:40.375
[phones chiming]

